#. おお、苗木誠殿…
#. どうしました？
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ah, Mr. Naegi. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. それが、十神クンの姿が見えないから
#. みんなで探そうって事になったんだ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...nobody's seen Byakuya this morning, so we've\n"
"all decided to go look for him."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんとっ！
#. それは一大事！
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Wh-What!? That's not good at all!"
msgstr ""

#. しかし…このブタめには…
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "However...this little piggy needs to..."
msgstr ""

#. ご主人様にロイヤルミルクティーをお届けするという
#. <CLT 3>聖なる指命<CLT>がありまして…！
msgctxt "0005 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I have a <CLT 3>holy edict<CLT> to deliver a proper milk tea to\n"
"my master!"
msgstr ""

#. ああ、このブタには身に余る光栄…！
#. 心を込めて奉仕致します、ご主人様ッ！
msgctxt "0006 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"To bless this undeserving swine with such an honor...!\n"
"I will serve you with all my heart and soul!"
msgstr ""

#. …そ、そう。
#. がんばってね…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Oh, okay. Good luck with that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クン、変な世界に行っちゃってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's created some creepy alternate reality for\n"
"himself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ああ、このブタには身に余る光栄…！
#. 心を込めて奉仕致します、ご主人様ッ！
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"To bless this undeserving swine with such an honor...!\n"
"I will serve you with all my heart and soul!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クン、変な世界に行っちゃってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's created some creepy alternate reality for\n"
"himself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. They\n"
"even put them in the kitchen...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと、
#. うかうか料理なんて出来ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's impossible to cook in here without thinking about\n"
"how he could reappear any second...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラ…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a surveillance camera in the kitchen, too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマに見られてると思うと、
#. 料理に集中なんて出来なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing Monokuma could be watching me, there's no way\n"
"I could concentrate on cooking anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>包丁は、ひとつ欠けたまま…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That one specific knife is still missing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにあった包丁を舞園さんが持ち出して…
#. そして…それで……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka took one of the knives that was here...and then\n"
"she...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このショーケースにケーキが並んでたら
#. 女の子たちが喜びそうだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I bet the girls would go crazy if something this big\n"
"was filled with cakes and sweets and stuff.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…そんな気分じゃないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...that's the wrong thing to be thinking right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>野菜が山積みになっている…
#. これはピーマンかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of vegetables all piled up. Ah, is\n"
"that a bell pepper?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あ、違う。
#. パプリカって野菜だな、これは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, no...it's just paprika.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>厨房から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the kitchen?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
